# cc-loop

Delivery engine only. Default loop: `goal → plan → implement → test → review → handoff`.

**0.12.0** · [INTEGRATION.md](docs/INTEGRATION.md) · [OPERATIONS.md](docs/OPERATIONS.md) · [AGENTS.md](Agents.md)

## Tests

```bash
make test && make clippy
```

## Layout

`rust/crates/cc-loop-cli` (binary) · `cc-loop-core` (engine) · `cc-loop-contract-tests`

## CLI

Global `--state-root` before subcommand. Day-to-day: `init` `doctor` `list` `status` `summary` `auto`. Ops: `graph` `report` `stop` `cancel` `cleanup` `eval` `export`.

## Invariants

`shell=false` · no `pkill -f` · process-group kill · dirty repo blocks · never switch user main checkout · handoff default · distinct reviewer · no merge on failed tests unless escaped · legacy `task_graph`-less state loads · contract breaks → update INTEGRATION.md
